<iscomment>
    PayPal V2 button container. The button/error ids are passed in via the
    `paypalButtonId`/`paypalErrorId` variables so PayPal can render in different
    placements (payment tab, place-order step) without DOM id collisions.
</iscomment>
<div id="${paypalErrorId}" class="js-hipay-paypalv2-error-message paypal-error-message"></div>
<div id="${paypalButtonId}" class="js-hipay-paypalv2-button" data-total="${pdict.total}"></div>
